Epicenter: use package-local Lucide icons because the registry's $lib icon
placeholder cannot resolve in @epicenter/ui. Capture's CaptureView and
Whispering's TranscriptCard import DropdownMenu.Root through the index, which
also imports the checkbox, radio and submenu parts.

